<!-- ripwire arch: layering fitness function — edges that violate your declared rules (layer rules and regex path-rules). exit=2 if any NEW (un-baselined) violation. <metrics> = descriptive Martin Ca/Ce/I/A/D + reachability, never gates. Rules — layer substrings and regex path-rules alike — are matched against each file's ROOT-RELATIVE path (src/core/x.cpp), never the absolute or ./-prefixed spelling shown in from=/to=, so a rule means the same thing whatever directory the tree was checked out into. no_file_edges=LANGS unmeasured_files=N graph_partial=1 (absent when none): N files are in languages whose imports this build almost never resolves to a file (Go only across a go.mod replace), so an edge through one was mostly never judged and violations= is a floor. <m zone=unknown no_file_edges=LANGS> holds such a file: with no edge observed its ca/ce/I/D/reachable are absent, unknown rather than zero; with one observed, ca/ce are floors over the resolved edges and I/D/leaf/isolated/reachable are absent, as no verdict is drawn from them. propagation_cost is absent when no edge is left among the measured files. masked_files=N (<metrics>, absent at 0): N no_file_edges= files are left out of the propagation_cost denominator, an edgeless one would add a cone of one and one with an edge has a cone that is only a floor; the number covers the other dependency-capable files. --><arch layers="2" rules="1" pathRules="0" violations="2" baselined="0" new_violations="2" no_file_edges="go" unmeasured_files="1" graph_partial="1"><v from="./test/extra.cpp" fromLayer="test" to="./render/shader.h" toLayer="render"/><v from="./test/main.cpp" fromLayer="test" to="./render/shader.h" toLayer="render"/><metrics modules="4" typed_modules="2" zone_pain="2" zone_useless="0" zone_ok="0" zone_na="1" zone_unknown="1" propagation_cost="0.375" masked_files="1" note="Martin Ca/Ce/I/A/D + zone (main-sequence heuristic, no independent outcome-based validation — folklore, not proof) + reachability — directory-level estimate from name-based deps; zone_na = types=0 modules excluded from zone_pain/zone_useless (no meaningful abstractness score); zone_ok = typed modules in neither corner (the main-sequence middle); zone_pain+zone_useless+zone_ok+zone_na+zone_unknown = modules, the full partition; propagation_cost = density of the file-dep transitive closure (MacCormack, validated coupling form) — fraction of files reachable from an average file; zone_unknown = modules holding a file in a language this build draws no file edges for (no_file_edges=): zone and coupling unknown, not zero, and part of the partition"><m path="." ca="0" ce="0" types="1" abstract="0" I="0.00" A="0.00" D="1.00" zone="pain" reachable="1" isolated="1"/><m path="./notes" types="0" abstract="0" A="0.00" zone="unknown" no_file_edges="go"/><m path="./render" ca="1" ce="0" types="1" abstract="0" I="0.00" A="0.00" D="1.00" zone="pain" reachable="1" leaf="1"/><m path="./test" ca="0" ce="1" types="0" abstract="0" I="1.00" A="0.00" D="0.00" zone="n/a" reachable="1"/></metrics></arch>